Z||000012||MinnGreenGT||08-23-2001||10:23 AM||||OUCH!  I still can't believe she did that!  My english teacher in HS told us about his Girlfriend when he was 18- they were cruising down the street (about 50mph) in his old 'Cuda (I think it was...) when he noticed her looking at the automatic shifter.  She asked what would happen if it was put into reverse while going forward.  Before he could say anything, she reached down and shoved it into reverse. BAM! The transmission was literally in pieces for a half a block behind the car.  Needless to say he was slightly displeased and she walked home- never to date him again!  I thank God that my wife was common sense.<P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/grngtsig3.jpg">     <P>Medium Metallic Green 87 GT<BR>3.1L High Output<BR>4 Spd OD Tranny<BR>Open (read: Loud) Exhaust<BR>and More!<BR>-Rob Bartlett||||reg||1
